    "type": "game",
    "name": "Economic Miracle",
    "steam_appid": 3738130,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/70cd84faf1458cf77dc841a31e681dce.avif?t=1753706658\" data-has-big width=800 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Have you been dreaming about a real economic and political simulator for a long time? Me too, so it's time to create something great!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a unique opportunity to lead any country in the world, playing the role of the spirit of the presidential branch of power. You will have to govern the state, and the parliament and the judicial system will hinder or help you. You will be able to feel like a ruler and lead your country to greatness, starting in 2020 and ending in 2100. Build the economy of the present and the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The future is in your hands: economy, politics, army, culture and science!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/93469d4c6068d4e55ce3025ede007b7a.poster.avif?t=1753706658\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/93469d4c6068d4e55ce3025ede007b7a.webm?t=1753706658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/93469d4c6068d4e55ce3025ede007b7a.mp4?t=1753706658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own economic system. The game has a well-developed system of trade, production, migration, diplomacy, duties, taxes and laws for every taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/f4c5fe00cbac197e9cc6845c4931d2a7.avif?t=1753706658\" data-has-big width=800 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>110 types of goods</u></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Dozens of types of services</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Quality system of goods (goods from Somalia have a hard time competing with goods from the USA)</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Real jobs</u></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Real population size - minimum of conventional values</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Residential construction system</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Ports and logistics</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Cryptocurrencies</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Central Bank</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Currency system and real exchange rate!</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Taxes, subsidies and funds</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>The ability to delegate each industry to private individuals!</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>And much more!</u></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/abd50c4e5eebcebf66cd75394c65347d.avif?t=1753706658\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real economy and state cannot work without domestic policy. In this game you have the opportunity to set up your domestic policy the way you really want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/18638bcd2d31f908db3a1c66af82e37c.avif?t=1753706658\" data-has-big width=800 height=75 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No fixed ideologies - you build your own form of power and politics.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Migration (internal and external. Create and change laws that will attract labor or encourage people to migrate)</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Healthcare</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Electricity</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Parliament and elections</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Ethnic policy</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Religion</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>And much more!</u></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/64bec10577027aeba6d45348ec517ce8.avif?t=1753706658\" width=782 height=781 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>You know what to do...</u></strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/70cd84faf1458cf77dc841a31e681dce.avif?t=1753706658\" data-has-big width=800 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Have you been dreaming about a real economic and political simulator for a long time? Me too, so it's time to create something great!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a unique opportunity to lead any country in the world, playing the role of the spirit of the presidential branch of power. You will have to govern the state, and the parliament and the judicial system will hinder or help you. You will be able to feel like a ruler and lead your country to greatness, starting in 2020 and ending in 2100. Build the economy of the present and the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The future is in your hands: economy, politics, army, culture and science!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/93469d4c6068d4e55ce3025ede007b7a.poster.avif?t=1753706658\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/93469d4c6068d4e55ce3025ede007b7a.webm?t=1753706658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/93469d4c6068d4e55ce3025ede007b7a.mp4?t=1753706658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own economic system. The game has a well-developed system of trade, production, migration, diplomacy, duties, taxes and laws for every taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/f4c5fe00cbac197e9cc6845c4931d2a7.avif?t=1753706658\" data-has-big width=800 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>110 types of goods</u></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Dozens of types of services</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Quality system of goods (goods from Somalia have a hard time competing with goods from the USA)</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Real jobs</u></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Real population size - minimum of conventional values</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Residential construction system</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Ports and logistics</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Cryptocurrencies</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Central Bank</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Currency system and real exchange rate!</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Taxes, subsidies and funds</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>The ability to delegate each industry to private individuals!</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>And much more!</u></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/abd50c4e5eebcebf66cd75394c65347d.avif?t=1753706658\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real economy and state cannot work without domestic policy. In this game you have the opportunity to set up your domestic policy the way you really want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/18638bcd2d31f908db3a1c66af82e37c.avif?t=1753706658\" data-has-big width=800 height=75 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No fixed ideologies - you build your own form of power and politics.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Migration (internal and external. Create and change laws that will attract labor or encourage people to migrate)</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Healthcare</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Electricity</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Parliament and elections</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Ethnic policy</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Religion</u></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>And much more!</u></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738130/extras/64bec10577027aeba6d45348ec517ce8.avif?t=1753706658\" width=782 height=781 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>You know what to do...</u></strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "Build your own state in the most detailed economic simulator! Playing for the government of any country in the world, you will have to conduct domestic and foreign policy, pass laws, carry out economic reforms and fight. Try a real simulator of modern times!",
